	(gr_text "Fab: JLCPCB\nStack-up: 4-layer, JLCO4161H-3313 (Dk ≈ 4.1, Df ≈ 0.02)\nCopper weight: 1oz (35µm) all layers\n\nImpedance control: USB D+/D-, RX+/RX-, TX+/TX-, SSRX+/SSRX-, SSTX+/SSTX-\ndifferential pairs, tightly coupled\n\nRouting style: Differential (Non-coplanar)\nflanking both sides, same layer\n\nTarget impedance: 90Ω ±10% differential (USB 3.0 spec)\nTrace width: 0.1527mm (6.0118 mil)\nDifferential gap (DP spacing): 0.2032mm (8.0000 mil)\nGround clearance: 0.2000mm (7.8740 mil)\n\nNote to fab: {dblquote}Controlled Impedance - 90Ω ±10% differential, \nnon-coplanar pairs, W=0.1527mm / S=0.2032mm / \nclearance=0.20000mm per attached stack-up{dblquote}\n\nSurface finish: ENIG recommended for fine-pitch USB-C connector pads\nSoldermask: Green\nSilkscreen: White (min 0.15mm line width)\nBOM/Parts sourcing: LCSC part numbers referenced in BOM for JLCPCB SMT assembly"
		(at 121.8055 81.163927 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
